1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,419
Exam tip.

2
00:00:01,419 --> 00:00:05,638
A hybrid is made by ordinary crossing between related plants.

3
00:00:05,638 --> 00:00:12,239
A transgenic plant carries a gene put in by a laboratory, often from a bacterium or an animal.

4
00:00:12,239 --> 00:00:15,768
A hybrid maize is not a G M O.

5
00:00:15,768 --> 00:00:20,052
Do not call every improved variety a G M O.

